# do-lines and sugar, checked against the control registry (CC0, written for the beatscript-api tests).
tempo 126
key am

deck A: kick e(5,8) | snare ~ x ~ x | hihat x*8 vel=60..90
deck B: harmony chord(am7) | arp arp(am7, up, 8)

every 16 bars: freeze phrase bars=2
at bar 8 for 4 bars: trick on deck=A kind=stutter
do vocoder set mix=0 -> 1 over 8 bars
wheel sync deck=A ratio=1/4
at bar 4: wheel interval beats=1/2 deck=A
master: reverb 0.2
